      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ROM",
          "chapter": 11,
          "verse": 10
        }
      ],
      "en": "Let their eyes be darkened, that they may not see. Always keep their backs bent.”",
      "ko": "저희 눈은 흐려 보지 못하고 저희 등은 항상 굽게 하옵소서 하였느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "ab1c5f7e6b024b1a46a7515f5bdd2b443f15298723794941f3ae1d268760a7fe",
      "translation_text_hash": "fb2c5e338209446bfce55f8f0f17f6dc8b05c004f83b70f6f6a17df3a0fe56db",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "저희 눈은 흐려 보지 못하고 저희 등은 항상 굽게 하옵소서 하였느니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "fb2c5e338209446bfce55f8f0f17f6dc8b05c004f83b70f6f6a17df3a0fe56db"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:ROM:11:11",
      "sequence": 28217,
      "chapter_label": "ROM 11",
      "verse_label": "11",
      "locator": {
