      "en": "You will say then, “Branches were broken off, that I might be grafted in.”",
      "ko": "그러면 네 말이 가지들이 꺾이운 것은 나로 접붙임을 받게 하려 함이라 하리니",
      "source_text_hash": "4f02117f19eb4504be2cdbe3ce450444886543f682a8b833af72e7fade03452c",
      "translation_text_hash": "9f7ea125b90df3b8dc42436f97a3534ecbe6aa473fa06aceb2edd47f90f74790",
